            <ArticleTitle>Spasm of the aortocoronary venous graft.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of spasm of the coronary artery bypass graft are reported, and the angiographic and clinical findings are discussed. Few previous reports of this entity were found in a search of the literature. The therapeutic implications are also presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
